/* Agent alert copy. A push carries only these keys, never prose and never an agent or product name, so
   a compromised agent cannot put its own words on a lock screen (Guideline 4.5.4). The title is fixed:
   Shortcuts automations and Focus filters match on it, so keep it stable. Literal on purpose: Apple's
   notification summaries and Focus filtering read this text, and quirky wording does not survive them. */
